# The default set of a fresh installation (lists, budgets, downloads: core/modules/defaults.ts) stays off in the test builds: every fresh test context would otherwise be a new installation with three more modules. `e2e/seed/defaults.seed.spec.ts` switches it on for its own context.
VITE_DEFAULTS_OFF=1
